    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d979">

                <pb facs="0826" n="816" xml:id="pg816"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.933/8–1849: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Counselor of Embassy in China</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Jones</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nanking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-08-18T16:00:00+08:00">August 18, 1949—4
                            p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received August 18—11:40 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1825. ReDepcirtel August 9.<anchor n="59" xml:id="d979-f1"/> Notice today given 8
                    USIS employees their services terminated as of close business September 3.
                    Balance of staff informed decision their cases pending. Final determination
                    number and names persons terminated will be made when reply [to] Embtel 1766,
                    August 12<anchor n="60" xml:id="d979-f2"/> (to Canton 739, Shanghai 967)
                    received. No action yet severance pay but expect demands from terminated
                    employees shortly.</p>
                <p>Sent Department 1825, repeated OffEmb Canton 777, Shanghai 1012.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jones</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d979-f1" n="59" xml:id="d979-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed; it reported the situation with regard to the United States
                    Information Service in Nanking (125.0093/7–3049).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d979-f2" n="60" xml:id="d979-f2-content">
                <p>Not printed; the Embassy recommended allowing posts to retain a limited staff for
                    custodial purposes in the USIS situation (124.933/S–1249).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
